 "strings": {
  "Chief Prosecutor Morita is more dangerous than he looks. But did Shintani really get shot with Ayabe's gun? I better meet up with Hoshino-kun at Genda Law Office to set something up with Ayabe.": "",
  "I knew I could count on Hoshino-kun. I better catch a cab so I can discuss matters with Ayabe.": "",
  "Find a Way to Meet Matsugane": "",
  "The Mole killed Shintani, and Hamura is the key. Maybe Matsugane-san might be able to track him down? Who do I know that's got an in with Matsugane-san?": "",
  "Get a Wiretap from Tsukumo": "",
  "Hamura has to be able to reach his boys. I need to set up a tap, and the guy for a job like that is Tsukumo. He should be in his usual internet café.": "",
  "Head to the Second Crime Scene": "",
  "We need to learn more about the Mole, but he's practically invisible. Maybe I'll find some clues at a previous crime scene...": "",
  "What is the deal with those masked robbers? Eh, forget it. I should go check in with Genda-sensei.": "",
  "Meet Kaito at Koi Bride": "",
  "Meeting up at a fish pond? What kind of officer is Ayabe, anyway?": "",
  "Check the Counter": "",
  "A test? Really? Wonder what's behind the counter...": "",
  "Go Downstairs": "",
  "Wow, an underground casino. The perfect place for a... cop?": "",
  "Play a Few Rounds": "",
  "Might as well try to fit in while I wait.": "",
  "Ayabe got me some intel on the Mole. I should give it a closer look back at the office.": "",
  "Check the Intel": "",
  "Did those guys attack me for what's in this envelope? It only makes me more curious.": "",
  "Gather Intel at Konban Wife": "",
  "Kunimura was the Mole's second victim, and he apparently hung out here. But Kaito isn't making this any easier...": "",
  "Head to the Matsugane Family Office": "",
  "So Hamura knew everything... But I'm glad I wasn't completely off the mark. Maybe Matsugane-san can make this easier on me.": "",
  "Head to Café Alps": "",
  "Hamura wants to meet up. Matsugane-san can't do anything, so it's time to take the bull by the horns.": "",
  "Take an Open Seat": "",
  "Hamura's not here yet. Guess I'll wait.": "",
  "The Matsugane Family wants us dead. I've gotta warn Kaito-san!": "",
  "Investigate Higashi": "",
  "Charles was just a spot for shady deals back when Kaito ran it. What does Higashi do there now?": "",
  "Report to Kaito": "",
  "It's been a year since 100 million yen got stolen from the Matsugane Family. What ever happened to the thief? I should fill Kaito-san in.": "",
  "Maybe I can get some info from Ayabe about the Matsugane Family robbery last year.": "",
  "Inquire about Red Nose": "",
  "The robber that knocked off the Matsugane Family was a homeless guy called Red Nose. Maybe some homeless guys would know if he's even still alive...": "",
  "Head to Paradise VR": "",
  "These places pop up faster than I can keep track of them. I guess I'll do what I can to find out more about Red Nose.": "",
  "Return to the Homeless Man": "",
  "Not gonna lie, that was fun. I should swing by again when I have some time. But for now, it's back to the Shichifuku Parking Lot.": "",
  "A volunteer group runs a soup kitchen at the Children's Park. Maybe someone there would have some info on Red Nose.": "",
  "Red Nose is long dead and, as it turns out, Higashi was looking for him. Could Higashi have killed him to return the missing money?": "",
  "Great, I've got the wiretap. Will Kaito-san have Sugiura with him? I'll wait at the office, I guess.": "",
  "Tail the Detective": "",
  "Wiretap the Matsugane Family": "",
  "I've got the tap and a perfect disguise. Just need to set it up now. And I swear, I'm gonna make Sugiura wear this crap when I'm done.": "",
  "Head to Pink Street": "",
  "I need to chase down that detective... I think he turned on Pink Street.": "",
  "Get Info at L'Amant": "",
  "Hamura's been at a gambling hall? Problem is, those places never stay put to avoid police raids... So I better ask the experts.": "",
  "Find the Gambling Hall": "",
  "A store with no signs in the Champion District? Shady as hell. And the password is... Uh, what was it again?": "",
  "Crash on the Sofa": "",
  "I could use some shuteye.": "",
  "Leave Amour": "",
  "Looks like it's pretty clear that Hamura kidnapped Kume. But was Amour really the scene of the crime?": "",
  "Matsugane-san should know where the Kyorei Clan is operating.": "",
  "Catch Up to Mafuyu": "",
  "Why are the yakuza tailing Mafuyu!? I need to catch up to her now!": "",
  "Defeat Honda": "",
  "He seems a little better than Kasai... But that doesn't make him less of a pain in the ass. He'll pay for what he did to Kim-san!": "",
  "Great timing, Kaito-san! These guys keep popping out of the woodwork!": "",
  "Wait for Saori to Get in Touch": "",
  "The power of makeup is not to be underestimated. It's up to you now, Saori-san.": "",
  "Capture the Matsugane Family Man": "",
  "We went through all the trouble of luring them out, so we can't let the chance escape us!": "",
  "Defeat the Lookout": "",
  "Sorry, but I don't have time for this. I've gotta get Kaito-san some medical attention!": "",
  "Find Kaito": "",
  "So this is Hamura's hideout? I'm walking into the lion's den, but this time I'm the predator!": "",
  "I need to help Kaito-san, but first I've gotta settle this. Hamura's gonna talk!": "",
  "Chase Kuroiwa": "",
  "So the Health Ministry is cutting the Mole off. But I can't let them erase the only human evidence!": "",
  "You're cornered, Kuroiwa, and you can't have Shono! I'll give you what you can have... An ass-kicking and a lifetime of regrets after you confess to everything!": "",
  "Question Hamura": "",
  "I finally have Hamura. It's time he told me everything about this case, starting with the Mole!": "",
  "I know who the Mole is, but now Matsugane-san is... Damn it! How many people have to die before he's satisfied!?": "",
  "This is far from over, but I'm useless if I'm tired. I'll sleep for now.": "",
  "The Mole already killed again? This time the victim was of the Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "I need evidence to prove Ayabe is innocent before his trial starts. But this might be all I can do today.": "",
  "I'm surprised Hattori believed me so easily. But I still need evidence to win the trial, so for now I'll work with Chairman Kajihira. But first, Kaito-san.": "",
  "I'm glad Kaito-san is okay. Better meet Chairman Kajihira at Kamuro Kikunoya for now.": "",
  "So Kido, the ADDC's director, is a skirt chasing asshole, huh? Maybe Saori-san would be willing to pitch in again.": "",
  "Recruit Saori Again": "",
  "I need Saori-san to lower Kido's guard long enough for me to learn the truth. But will she agree?": "",
  "Meet up with Sugiura": "",
  "Couldn't have asked for better from Saori-san. How do I get her to come work for me...? Anyway, Sugiura and the others are waiting at the batting cages.": "",
  "Question Kido": "",
  "This is how you reduce a director to a whimpering pile of shit. I better ask all the questions I need before I get interrupted.": "",
  "Head to the Millennium Tower": "",
  "Shono's lab... Why would it be in Kamurocho? Ishimatsu must know where it is, so I'll stake out the Millennium Tower for him.": "",
  "Enter the Batting Center": "",
  "Kido showed up, right on cue. Must not want that video going public.": "",
  "Mafuyu is being watched, and she's been targeted by the Kyorei Clan before. This time, I'll be with her. I better hurry over to Tender.": "",
  "Escort Mafuyu": "",
  "Sounds like Chief Prosecutor Morita has a complex past. I need to get Mafuyu safely to the Children's Park where we'll meet the detective from that case.": "",
  "So that detective used to be a cop... Not that I have any room to talk. Let's get to Genda Law Office.": "",
  "Walk Mafuyu to a Taxi": "",
  "Never figured I'd be standing in court again. Here's my stage to prove Ayabe and Okubo-kun innocent. And this is one show I have to perform flawlessly!": "",
  "What does Izumida want with Mafuyu? He may be on Chief Prosecutor Morita's side, too. I better meet him in her place.": "",
  "I was wrong about Izumida. He's an ass, but even asses have hearts. Thanks to him, we can drag Ichinose to court. Tomorrow's a new day.": "",
  "The Matsugane Family thing is partially on me. I need to get this sorted.": "",
  "The defense needs testimony from Kido to make this work. But I need him to do it willingly. I better head to the ADDC. Sorry, no time for appointments.": "",
  "Head to the Detention Center": "",
  "Now that everything about Sugiura is out in the open, he can drop his grudge against Okubo-kun. I should let him know.": "",
  "Everything's ready to start the trial. I'll head to Genda Law Office.": "",
  "Chief Prosecutor Morita's at L'Amant. I should go say hi.": "",
  "Stand in Court": "",
  "It's time. We're going to settle this, once and for all.": "",
  "Head to Kyushu No. 1 Star": "",
  "So, Hattori knows about AD-9? I hate having to ask him for anything... especially politely.": "",
  "Review the Case at the Office": "",
  "Shono is the researcher behind AD-9. If I can piece together what I know so far, I'm sure I'll figure something out.": "",
  "Keep Organizing the Information": "",
  "If the Mole is murdering Shono's human experiments... Could Waku's murder have been for the same reason? Just a thought, but...": "",
  "If Okubo-kun is really innocent of the murder three years ago, then it's possible Waku-san was also a human experiment. I need to face that case again in Genda-sensei's files.": "",
  "Investigate the Terasawa Case": "",
  "It's not just Waku-san's case. It's Emi-chan's murder too. I have to read all this thoroughly before I meet with Okubo-kun.": "",
  "Get a Taxi on West Shichifuku Street": "",
  "Hoshino-kun is waiting to grab a cab to the Tokyo Detention Facility on Shichifuku Street.": "",
  "Okubo-kun has been innocent the whole time. But I didn't believe him. Damn it! I need to cool off at Tender.": "",
  "Hamura has me in his sights. I'd rather lay low, but we're meeting at KJ Art? You sure this is a good idea, Kaito-san?": "",
  "I have to confront Shono directly. I'll stake out the lobby until he shows himself.": "",
  "Find Shono": "",
  "This place always feels massive. I hope I can find Shono...": "",
  "Find a Way to Meet Shono": "",
  "Vice Minister Ichinose is a tricky devil. But I'm not going to just roll over. What now?": "",
  "Go Outside": "",
  "Looks like I can sneak in through the parking lot underground. I'll go scout out a route.": "",
  "Verify the Infiltration Route": "",
  "This is the parking lot I was in three years ago. Both Shintani and Emi-chan are gone now...": "",
  "Scout the Matsugane Family Office": "",
  "Where is Hamura now? No way he's still gambling. I'll hit the office with the drone.": "",
  "Lure the Matsugane Family Out": "",
  "If I want to get Hamura out, I'll need to make a scene in the city. But how?": "",
  "Head to the Soleil Building": "",
  "So Hamura's not below pointing a gun even at Matsugane-san, huh? And Kaito is injured, too. I'm coming for you, Hamura!": "",
  "Head to Mantai Internet Café": "",
  "When it comes to finding people, nobody beats this guy. He hangs out at an internet café in Theater Square.": "",
  "I'll meet up with Ayabe at my office tomorrow. I better have the 100,000 yen fee ready before then.": "",
  "Tail Higashi": "",
  "What happened to Higashi over the last year? Learning where he goes is a start.": "",
  "Meet with Murase": "",
  "Lucky me. Shioya's not here right now. Better head to Murase's room.": "",
  "Defeat the Shakedown Yakuza": "",
  "What a pain in the ass. Maybe they'll shut up if I hit them enough.": "",
  "Scout Out KJ Art with the Drone": "",
  "I'll use the drone to check the situation at KJ Art. If Murase's there, this'll be easier.": "",
  "Defeat the Police": "",
  "This goes all the way to the top! But if I don't stop Kuroiwa, Shono's as good as dead! I'm sorry, officers!": "",
  "Break Through": "",
  "Mission Test": "",
  "Catch the Panty Thief": "",
  "Meet the Client at M Side Cafe": "",
  "The clients, two siblings, are at M Side Cafe.": "",
  "Buy Some Panties": "",
  "I need to buy panties at Le Marche. Should be red or black lace with a decorative ribbon. This'll be fun.": "",
  "Set the Panty Bait": "",
  "The panty bait needs to go on the roof, but the upper floors are locked. I'll have to sneak in.": "",
  "Head to the GPS Source": "",
  "Panty Professor fell right into my trap. I can track his location now.": "",
  "Let's Chat About a Pervert": "",
  "Yosuke wants me to meet him at M Side Cafe.": "",
  "Find Judge Creep 'n Peep in the Hotel District.": "",
  "So this creep sticks to the Hotel District walls? ...Sure. I'll believe anything at this point.": "",
  "Defeat Judge Creep 'n Peep": "",
  "This guy's wearing protective googles! Will they stop me?": "",
  "Head to the Back Alley": "",
  "Tsukino-chan's scream came from behind Public Park 3. There's a shortcut over this wall!": "",
  "Head to the Hotel District": "",
  "Giant Impact will probably be in the Hotel District. I should stake it out.": "",
  "Search for Giant Impact": "",
  "Tail the Man Resembling Giant Impact": "",
  "Tail Giant Impact": "",
  "Request from a Book Publisher": "",
  "Meet the Client at Mijore": "",
  "The client is waiting at Mijore. He's apparently a normal-looking guy in a suit.": "",
  "Talk to Kuwada-san": "",
  "I should speak with Kawada when I'm ready.": "",
  "Solve the Safe Code": "",
  "I've got to solve this tricky problem for my client. Sounds fun?": "",
  "Return With Kawada-san": "",
  "I'll let Kawada-san know when I'm ready to take a crack at the code.": "",
  "Another Publishing Request": "",
  "The client is waiting at Café Mijore.": "",
  "Speak with Kawada": "",
  "I've got to solve this tricky problem for my client. Again.": "",
  "A Final Event": "",
  "Kawada-san is waiting at Café Mijore.": "",
  "I've got to solve this tricky problem for my client. I hope this is it.": "",
  "Head to Heavy Coffee": "",
  "I'll stake out Heavy Coffee on Taihei Boulevard until Taguchi-san's husband shows up.": "",
  "A Sexual Harassment Investigation": "",
  "The client is waiting at Café Mijore. She's apparently a black-haired woman with large breasts. I should probably try not to focus on that last detail.": "",
  "Head to Isetani Trading Company": "",
  "Isetani Trading Company should be on the fourth floor of the building on Senryo Avenue with Nyan Nyan Cat Café in it. I've gotta see what's going on in the office.": "",
  "Buy Janitor Clothes": "",
  "If I can get my hands on a janitor's outfit, I can infiltrate Isetani Trading.": "",
  "Infiltrate Isetani Trading Company": "",
  "I need to put on a disguise before heading into Isetani Trading Co.": "",
  "Figure Out How to Photograph the Office": "",
  "I got kicked out... But maybe there's a way to get an eye inside?": "",
  "Observe the Office": "",
  "Go Outside to Get a Better View": "",
  "I'm worried about Miyamoto-san meeting Iseya by herself. I should see if the drone can help me out here.": "",
  "Listen to Sana's Singing": "",
  "Apparently Sana-chan sings in Theater Square often. I should check back.": "",
  "Tail Saito": "",
  "Eavesdrop on Saito": "",
  "Saito is talking to some shady dude. He knows my face, so I'll need to be careful about getting close enough to hear their conversation.": "",
  "Report to Sana-chan at Theater Square": "",
  "Saito was a piece of shit. Sana-chan needs to hear this.": "",
  "Search for Sana-chan": "",
  "Saito-san kidnapped Sana-chan! She's apparently at his office, but where is it? Do I have any clues?": "",
  "Look for Deguchi on Pink Street": "",
  "Apparently Deguchi's been sighted there. I should check it out.": "",
  "Find Deguchi": "",
  "Go to Pink Street and look for Meguro": "",
  "He apparently headed toward Pink Street.": "",
  "Go to Tenkaichi Street and look for Meguro": "",
  "Meguro headed toward Tenkaichi Street. What's in his cards this time?": "",
  "I need to find Mamoru in Theater Square.": "",
  "Mamoru-san's phone is in Theater Square. Let's head there first.": "",
  "Head to Kamuro Hills": "",
  "A suspicious man wants me at Kamuro Hills. Guess I've got no choice.": "",
  "Catch the... Hat?": "",
  "Chase the Wig": "",
  "After the Chase": "",
  "Tail the Yakuza": "",
  "Go to the Hills Garden on Park Boulevard": "",
  "An anonymous client is waiting for me at the Hills Garden on Park Boulevard.": "",
  "Go to Tenkaichi Alley": "",
  "I met Jester in Tenkaichi Alley. I'll check around there.": "",
  "Meet the Man": "",
  "The masked man was on the roof of Stardust. I've gotta catch him!": "",
  "Head to Senryo Avenue": "",
  "Okay, I hope we get some clues here.": "",
  "Head to Kamuro Theater Garden": "",
  "The guys said they'd meet up in the theater garden. Let's see what they have to say.": "",
  "Meet the Client Again": "",
  "I should head to the Hills Garden on Park Boulevard. Jester's search for Crow doesn't seem very noble...": "",
  "Defeat the Masked Men": "",
  "I knew these guys were up to no good.": "",
  "Defeat Crow": "",
  "I didn't really want it to come to this, but this is how it is these days, I guess.": "",
  "Head to Public Park 3": "",
  "What did Kaito-san mean when he said he had a job for me?": "",
  "Head to Suppon Street": "",
  "I'll check out Suppon Street, where Kaito said he beat the thugs. Maybe we'll get some clues on the father.": "",
  "Search for Clues": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Crash on the Sofa": "นอนบนโซฟา",
  "Head to the Millennium Tower": "ไปที่มิลเลนเนียมทาวเวอร์",
  "Mission Test": "ทดสอบภารกิจ",
  "Let's Chat About a Pervert": "มาคุยกันเรื่องโรคจิตกันหน่อย",
  "A Final Event": "เหตุการณ์สุดท้าย",
  "Head to Public Park 3": "ไปที่สวนสาธารณะ 3"
 }
}
